{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You\u2019re Benjamin</strong>, a desperate lowlife with debts you can\u2019t escape. Armed with your <strong>fists</strong>, <strong>trash talk</strong>, and a <strong>boxcutter</strong>, you fight to survive in the crooked city of\u00a0<strong>Copenhagen</strong> that couldn\u2019t care less if you make it out...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/44262337c4ed66c50b7c10bce2f932eb.poster.avif?t=1758648831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/44262337c4ed66c50b7c10bce2f932eb.webm?t=1758648831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break</strong> into cars, <strong>rip</strong> out stereos and <strong>pocket</strong> what's yours. <strong>Rob</strong> the store, <strong>snatch</strong> bottles off the street and <strong>take</strong> every scrap you can find. Theft isn\u2019t optional, it\u2019s survival...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/adbb878a045ce31478312b4789c6eda2.poster.avif?t=1758648831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/adbb878a045ce31478312b4789c6eda2.webm?t=1758648831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade your loot for dirty cash</strong>, the only currency that keeps you moving forward. Nothing in Copenhagen comes free, and every coin you scrape together pushes you closer to crawling out of debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/12d9b1e2c60436aa44d5d264da44f6c3.poster.avif?t=1758648831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/12d9b1e2c60436aa44d5d264da44f6c3.webm?t=1758648831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your cash on  improving your apartment, fresh clothes, or masks that give you strange buffs and a warped sense of identity. <strong>Comfort doesn\u2019t last, but it might keep you alive.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/226a41f5aa02d04800247b7bd9da096c.poster.avif?t=1758648831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/226a41f5aa02d04800247b7bd9da096c.webm?t=1758648831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash-talk strangers, push back against gangs and <strong>let your  boxcutter do the rest</strong>. Violence and fear are your only real languages in these streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/6474b38d11041a02b61286b3a31664f2.poster.avif?t=1758648831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/6474b38d11041a02b61286b3a31664f2.webm?t=1758648831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam a distorted version of <strong>Copenhagen</strong> in the early 2000s.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020370?t=1758648831","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/b6b3f9fbd0666e9d292f2fcdfa1b4f0bad267c80/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758648831","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/9391df14a06e293271e90e40353de861e5d053b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758648831","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/9391df14a06e293271e90e40353de861e5d053b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758648831","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Boxcutter contains profanity, murder and gives the player the ability to access excessive gore including dismemberment, blood, gambling with in-game currency and tobacco use.  \r\nNOTE: Dismemberment and blood can be toggled off at any time."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You\u2019re Benjamin</strong>, a desperate lowlife with debts you can\u2019t escape. Armed with your <strong>fists</strong>, <strong>trash talk</strong>, and a <strong>boxcutter</strong>, you fight to survive in the crooked city of\u00a0<strong>Copenhagen</strong> that couldn\u2019t care less if you make it out...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/44262337c4ed66c50b7c10bce2f932eb.poster.avif?t=1758648831\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/44